lt-finding and repairs for unwanted drips, leaks and slow drains.</p>\n          </article>\n\n          <article class=\"service-card\">\n            <span class=\"service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 20h16M6 20V9l6-5 6 5v11M9 20v-6h6v6M4 9h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n            </span>\n            <h3>Home improvements</h3>\n            <p>Thoughtful plumbing work for home upgrades, extensions and the projects in between.</p>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"about\" id=\"about\">\n      <div class=\"wrap about-grid\">\n        <div class=\"about-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M110 14c-28 39-57 70-57 112a57 57 0 0 0 114 0c0-42-29-73-57-112Z\" fill=\"#72bdb0\"/>\n            <path d=\"M110 38c-21 30-42 54-42 86a42 42 0 0 0 84 0c0-32-21-56-42-86Z\" fill=\"#a9d8ce\"/>\n            <path d=\"M84 124c0 16 12 29 28 31\" stroke=\"#fffefa\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M110 14c-28 39-57 70-57 112a57 57 0 0 0 114 0c0-42-29-73-57-112Z\" stroke=\"#fffefa\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"about-copy\">\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">A little about us</p>\n          <h2>Family-run. Neighbour-approved.</h2>\n          <p>We\u2019re a small family plumbing business built on a simple idea: treat every home like it belongs to someone you know. That means listening first, explaining the work clearly and leaving things neat when we\u2019re done.</p>\n          <p>Based in Leeds, we\u2019re proud to help homeowners across the city and nearby communities.</p>\n          <ul class=\"about-points\">\n            <li><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidde